  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato, carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-da836fe2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over dukkah and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-68102120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. in a medium bowl, combine ras el hanout seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper. Add haloumi and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-1474eb8c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Remove from heat, add honey and turn to coat.\n• Transfer to a plate to rest for 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-aa32ca3c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies are done, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of vinegar to the tray. Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-30addf31.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide dukkah roast veggie toss between plates.\n• Top with ras el hanout haloumi.\n• Dollop over garlic aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6422876a57e9bf4828029872/step-9e369745.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
